Package: fetchloom
Title: Place Pinned Research Data with 'fetchloom'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Nikhil", "Y N", email = "nikhilylkn@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Runs the 'fetchloom' program, which pins the data a project uses
    from published or shared places by SHA-256 and places those exact bytes on
    any machine. path() returns where a dataset is placed, sync() places a
    project's data and download() gets a link once, each raising the kind and
    help 'fetchloom' gives when it fails.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://github.com/nikhil-yn-aix/fetchloom
BugReports: https://github.com/nikhil-yn-aix/fetchloom/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr
SystemRequirements: fetchloom (https://github.com/nikhil-yn-aix/fetchloom#install)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
